{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14984","headline":"同耿湋司空曙二拾遗题韦员外东斋花树 · 卢纶","name":"同耿湋司空曙二拾遗题韦员外东斋花树","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绿砌红花树，狂风独未吹。\n光中疑有焰，密处似无枝。\n鸟动香轻发，人愁影屡移。\n今朝数片落，爲报汉郎知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14984.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14984","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}